     1575   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF Rs-obj-type IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1576   DO:
     1577       assign
     1578     RS-obj-type.
     1579     if   input frame Dialog-Frame f-obj-code <> 0 then do:
     1580       run check-obj in this-procedure no-error.
